/* Glass: liquid, in the agent pane. Over clear glass and a bright painting the chat's own glass (the
   composer, popovers, menus, hover cards) needs a tint floor to keep text at 4.5:1: the glass lab
   measured 3.9:1 on a selected row at a 60% tint and 5.0:1 at 70% (the tint floor skin).
   This raises each text-bearing level to 70% or more and leaves the blur alone, so Reduce
   Transparency still turns the glass off. The material keeps its colors vivid behind the frost. */
:root {
  --ds-glass-chrome-tint: 70%;
  --ds-glass-popover-tint: 74%;
  --ds-glass-popover-art-tint: 70%;
  --ds-glass-chip-tint: 72%;
  --glass-material-saturate: 2;
}
